    narr:narration """The narrative surrounding [decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) as a primary product differentiator has transitioned from a foundational design principle established in March 2026 to concrete operational validation by late August. The current trajectory centers on the successful implementation of the [async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_1), which serves as the tangible artifact of the core thesis. This deployment is linked to a [peak in team velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_2), with the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_3) identified as the critical technical catalyst for this performance. While the initial framing focused on the conceptual necessity of capturing consensus, the recent discourse shifts toward quantifying the impact of these features on team output and technical integration efficiency.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "decision capture at the point of consensus" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We shipped the async decision widget." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Velocity was 23 points, highest this quarter." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Zephyr integration was the key unlock." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The focus on 'competence' and 'communal sharing' in the widget deployment contrasts with the 'self-enhancement' and 'market-pricing' framing of velocity metrics." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787564412032_2> ] ;
    narr:writer "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite" .
